internal/auth/common-passwords.txt and the breached password filter in
internal/auth/breached/ are made from SecLists,
https://github.com/danielmiessler/SecLists, at commit
68bcd12457978649d41ae4f56e3b5d2db2b72560:

- common-passwords.txt: the first 10000 entries of 8 characters or more, in
  lower case, without repeats, of
  Passwords/Common-Credentials/xato-net-10-million-passwords-100000.txt.
- breached/0.bin to 3.bin: a Bloom filter (not the passwords themselves)
  over 1000000 entries of 8 characters or more, in lower case, without
  repeats: all such entries of
  Passwords/Common-Credentials/xato-net-10-million-passwords-1000000.txt,
  then the first such entries of rockyou.txt in
  Passwords/Leaked-Databases/rockyou.txt.tar.gz. tools/breachgen makes it
  and names the files' SHA-256.

